## Phase 4 — Scientific Validation Suite (Week 5-7)

### External Benchmark 1: Campaign Reconstruction
- Take 5 real luxury campaign images (public domain / reference).
- Feed the product description into the system.
- Compare the system's Creative State decisions against the real campaign's actual lighting/camera/grading.
- Score: How many decisions did the system get right?

### External Benchmark 2: Objective Variance
- Single saree → generate under 4 different Creative Objectives (Catalog, Bridal, Editorial, UGC).
- Human judges score each for appropriateness to its objective.

### External Benchmark 3: A/B Test
- Prompt-only workflow (user writes their own prompt) vs. Creative Intelligence workflow.
- Measure: Product Fidelity, Luxury Perception, Consistency, Human Preference.

### Business Metrics Dashboard
| Metric | How it's measured |
|---|---|
| Product Fidelity | Can a merchant identify the product? (1-10 score) |
| Brand Fidelity | Does it match the positioning? (1-10 score) |
| Visual Realism | Can photographers tell it's AI? (blind test %) |
| Commercial Utility | Would a brand publish this? (yes/no + confidence) |
| Edit Distance | Minutes of manual editing before approval |
| Approval Rate | % of generated assets approved on first attempt |

